⍝ D-92: a fractional axis after , laminates (dyadic) or adds a unit axis (monadic)
🍎> 1 2 3,[0.5]4 5 6
⍝ expect: 1 2 3
⍝ expect: 4 5 6
🍎> 1 2 3,[1.5]4 5 6
⍝ expect: 1 4
⍝ expect: 2 5
⍝ expect: 3 6
🍎> 1,[0.5]2 3
⍝ expect: 1 1
⍝ expect: 2 3
🍎> 'ab',[0.5]'cd'
⍝ expect: ab
⍝ expect: cd
🍎> (⊂'ab'),[0.5]⊂'cd'
⍝ expect: 'ab' 'cd'
🍎> ⍴,[0.5]1 2 3
⍝ expect: 1 3
🍎> ⍴,[1.5]1 2 3
⍝ expect: 3 1
🍎> ⍴(2 3⍴1),[0.5]2 3⍴2
⍝ expect: 2 2 3
🍎> ⍴(2 3⍴1),[2.5]2 3⍴2
⍝ expect: 2 3 2
🍎> ⎕IO←0
🍎> 1 2,[¯0.5]3 4
⍝ expect: 1 2
⍝ expect: 3 4
🍎> ⎕IO←1
🍎> 1 2 3,[0.5]4 5
⍝ refuse: %length-error
🍎> 1 2,[0.5]2 2⍴1
⍝ refuse: %rank-error
🍎> 1 2,[2.5]3 4
⍝ refuse: %axis-error
🍎> 1 2⌽[0.5]3 4
⍝ refuse: %axis-error
